===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# something given in [[exchange]] for [[goods]] or [[service]]s [[rendered]]
# a [[payment]] for [[work]] done; [[wage]]s, [[salary]], [[emolument]]
# a [[recompense]] for a [[loss]]; [[compensation]]

